{
    "id": "au.medical-records",
    "version": 1,
    "name": "Australian Medical Records",
    "emoji": "🇦🇺",
    "description": "Australian hospital, GP, specialist and pathology records: clinic letters, discharge summaries, pathology and radiology reports. Detects DVA file numbers (NX123456, VSM12345, QX12345A, after DVA No., DVA File Number, Gold Card or White Card and on their own), Medicare card numbers with the IRN (2123 45670 1 / 2), the IHI (8003 6012 3456 7890), the value after UR, URN, MRN, Hospital No. or Chart No., hospital numbers of 6 or more digits, dates (dd/mm/yyyy and long form, and every form after DOB or Date of Birth), postcodes after the state (Parramatta NSW 2150), Australian phone and mobile numbers ((02) 9123 4567, +61 412 345 678) and patient names. The value after a Patient Name, Patient Address or Patient ID label is covered too, while the label stays readable. Lab values, doses, Medicare item numbers, 1300 and 1800 numbers and the clinic's ABN stay visible. The doctor's Medicare provider number and AHPRA registration stay visible too: turn on Provider No and AHPRA to cover them. Handwritten signatures need the Signatures switch or a manual box.",
    "language": "en",
    "country": "AU",
    "tags": [
        "medical",
        "healthcare",
        "hospital",
        "gp",
        "clinical",
        "patient",
        "pathology",
        "australia",
        "medicare",
        "dva",
        "ihi",
        "privacy"
    ],
    "patterns": [
        {
            "name": "Medicare",
            "regex": "(?:(?<=[ \\r\\n:])(?=[2-6](?:[ \\-]?\\d){9})(?<=\\bmedicare(?:[ \\t]?card)?(?:[ \\t]?(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number))?(?:[ \\t]?(?:/|&|and)[ \\t]?(?:irn|ref(?:\\.|erence)?(?:[ \\t]?no\\.?)?))?\\)?(?:[ \\t]{0,3}(?:[:.#=\\-–—][ \\t]{0,3}){0,3}[ \\t]{0,19}[ ]|[ \\t]{0,3}[:#][ \\t]{0,10}(?:\\r\\n|\\r|\\n)(?:[ \\t]{0,29}[ ])?|[ \\t]{0,3}:))(?<![A-Za-z0-9])[2-6](?:[ \\-]?\\d){9}(?:[ ]?[/\\-][ ]?[1-9]|[ ]?\\([1-9]\\)|[ ]{1,3}\\(?(?:irn|ref(?:\\.|erence)?(?:[ ]?no\\.?)?)\\)?[ \\t]{0,3}[:.#]?[ \\t]{0,3}[1-9]|[ ][1-9](?![\\d/.\\-]))?(?!\\d)|(?<![A-Za-z0-9.,/\\-+])[2-6]\\d{3}[ ]\\d{5}[ ]\\d(?:[ ]?[/\\-][ ]?[1-9]|[ ]?\\([1-9]\\)|[ ]{1,3}\\(?(?:irn|ref(?:\\.|erence)?(?:[ ]?no\\.?)?)\\)?[ \\t]{0,3}[:.#]?[ \\t]{0,3}[1-9]|[ ][1-9](?![\\d/.\\-]))?(?![\\d.,]))",
            "description": "Medicare card number: 10 digits printed 4-5-1 (2123 45670 1), with the IRN after it (2123 45670 1 / 2, 2123456701-2, IRN 2), on its own or after Medicare, Medicare No., Medicare Number or Medicare Card in any spacing. Medicare item numbers (item 110) stay visible.",
            "enabled": true
        },
        {
            "name": "DVA",
            "regex": "(?-i)(?:(?<=[ \\r\\n:])(?=[NVQSWT](?:[A-Z]{1,3}[ ]?|[ ])?\\d)(?<=(?i:\\bd\\.?v\\.?a\\.?(?:[ \\t]?(?:file|card|client|gold[ \\t]card|white[ \\t]card|orange[ \\t]card))?(?:[ \\t]?(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number))?|\\bveteran(?:['’]?s['’]?)?[ \\t]?(?:file|card)[ \\t]?(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number)|\\bveterans['’]?[ \\t]affairs(?:[ \\t]?file)?[ \\t]?(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number)|\\b(?:gold|white|orange)[ \\t]card(?:[ \\t]?(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number))?)\\)?(?:[ \\t]{0,3}(?:[:.#=\\-–—][ \\t]{0,3}){0,3}[ \\t]{0,19}[ ]|[ \\t]{0,3}[:#][ \\t]{0,10}(?:\\r\\n|\\r|\\n)(?:[ \\t]{0,29}[ ])?|[ \\t]{0,3}:))(?<![A-Za-z0-9])[NVQSWT](?:[A-Z]{1,3}[ ]?|[ ])?\\d{1,6}[A-Z]?(?![A-Za-z0-9])|(?<![A-Za-z0-9])[NVQSWT](?:[A-Z]\\d{5,6}|[A-Z]{2}\\d{4,5}|[A-Z]{3}\\d{4})[A-Z]?(?![A-Za-z0-9]))",
            "description": "DVA file number (Department of Veterans' Affairs): state letter N, V, Q, S, W or T, war code, digits and an optional letter (NX123456, VSM12345, QX12345A, WKM01234, T123456, N 123456), after DVA, DVA No., DVA Number, DVA File No., DVA Card No., Gold Card, White Card or Veteran File Number. On its own only in the full shape with a war code (NX123456, QSM12345A).",
            "enabled": true
        },
        {
            "name": "IHI",
            "regex": "(?:(?<=[ \\r\\n:])(?=\\d(?:[ \\-]?\\d){15}(?!\\d))(?<=(?:\\bihi(?:[ \\t]?(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number))?|\\bindividual[ \\t]health(?:care|[ \\t]care)?[ \\t](?:identifier|id)(?:[ \\t]?(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number))?)\\)?(?:[ \\t]{0,3}(?:[:.#=\\-–—][ \\t]{0,3}){0,3}[ \\t]{0,19}[ ]|[ \\t]{0,3}[:#][ \\t]{0,10}(?:\\r\\n|\\r|\\n)(?:[ \\t]{0,29}[ ])?|[ \\t]{0,3}:))(?<![A-Za-z0-9])\\d(?:[ \\-]?\\d){15}(?!\\d)|(?<![\\d.,])8003[ \\-]?60(?:[ \\-]?\\d){10}(?![\\d.,]))",
            "description": "Individual Healthcare Identifier: 16 digits starting 8003 60 (8003 6012 3456 7890), on its own or after IHI, IHI No. or Individual Healthcare Identifier.",
            "enabled": true
        },
        {
            "name": "MRN",
            "regex": "(?<=[ \\r\\n:])(?=[A-Za-z0-9\\-/.]*\\d)(?<=(?:\\b(?:mrn|m\\.r\\.n\\.?|umrn|urn|ur)(?:[ \\t]?(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number))?|\\b(?:medical[ \\t]record|med\\.?[ \\t]?rec\\.?|chart|unit[ \\t]record)[ \\t]?(?:(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number)|id)|\\bhosp(?:ital|\\.)?[ \\t]?(?:(?:\\#|no\\.?|nr\\.?|num\\.?|number)|id))(?:[ \\t]{0,3}(?:[:.#=\\-–—][ \\t]{0,3}){0,3}[ \\t]{0,19}[ ]|[ \\t]{0,3}[:#][ \\t]{0,10}(?:\\r\\n|\\r|\\n)(?:[ \\t]{0,29}[ ])?|[ \\t]{0,3}:))(?<![A-Za-z0-9])(?!\\d{1,4}[/.\\-]\\d{1,2}[/.\\-]\\d{1,4}(?![A-Za-z0-9])|\\d{3}[ ]\\d{3}[ ]\\d{4}(?!\\d))(?=[A-Za-z0-9\\-/.]*\\d)[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9]|[\\-/.](?=[A-Za-z0-9])){2,39}(?![A-Za-z0-9])|(?<![\\d.,])(?=\\d{6})(?<!(?:MED|NMW|DEN|PHA|PSY|PHY|OPT|CHI|OST|POD|OCC|MRP|CMR|ATS|PAR))(?<!\\b(?:abn|acn|sctid|snomed(?:[ \\t]?ct(?:[ \\t\\-]?au)?)?)[ \\t]{0,3}[:.#]?[ \\t]{0,3})(?!\\d{6}[0-9A-HJ-NP-Y][ABFHJKLTWXY](?![A-Za-z0-9]))\\d{6,}(?![\\d.,])",
            "description": "Hospital number, UR or MRN: 6 or more digits in a row with no digit, period or comma next to them, and the value after MRN, UR, UR No., URN, UMRN, Unit Record No., Hospital No., Medical Record Number or Chart No. (UR: 0123456, MRN-00123, A1234567) with the label left readable. Lab values like 12.4 or 1,234.56, short numbers, the doctor's provider number and AHPRA number and the clinic's ABN stay visible.",
            "enabled": true
        },
        {
            "name": "Date",
            "regex": "(?:\\b(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])[/\\-](?:0?[1-9]|1[0-2])[/\\-](?:19|20)\\d{2}\\b)|(?:\\b\\d{1,2}(?:st|nd|rd|th)?\\s+(?:Jan(?:uary)?|Feb(?:ruary)?|Mar(?:ch)?|Apr(?:il)?|May|Jun(?:e)?|Jul(?:y)?|Aug(?:ust)?|Sept?(?:ember)?|Oct(?:ober)?|Nov(?:ember)?|Dec(?:ember)?)\\.?\\s+(?:19|20)\\d{2}\\b)|(?:\\b(?:Jan(?:uary)?|Feb(?:ruary)?|Mar(?:ch)?|Apr(?:il)?|May|Jun(?:e)?|Jul(?:y)?|Aug(?:ust)?|Sept?(?:ember)?|Oct(?:ober)?|Nov(?:ember)?|Dec(?:ember)?)\\.?\\s+\\d{1,2},?\\s+(?:19|20)\\d{2}\\b)|(?:(?<=[ \\r\\n])(?=\\d)(?<=(?:\\b(?:dob|d\\.o\\.b\\.?|date[ \\t]of[ \\t]birth|birth[ \\t]?date))(?:[ \\t]{0,3}(?:[:.#=\\-–—][ \\t]{0,3}){0,3}[ \\t]{0,19}[ ]|[ \\t]{0,3}[:#][ \\t]{0,10}(?:\\r\\n|\\r|\\n)(?:[ \\t]{0,29}[ ])?))(?:(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])[/.\\-](?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])[/.\\-](?:(?:19|20)\\d{2}|\\d{2})(?!\\d|[/.\\-]\\d)|(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])(?:st|nd|rd|th)?[ \\-./]?(?:Jan(?:uary)?|Feb(?:ruary)?|Mar(?:ch)?|Apr(?:il)?|May|Jun(?:e)?|Jul(?:y)?|Aug(?:ust)?|Sept?(?:ember)?|Oct(?:ober)?|Nov(?:ember)?|Dec(?:ember)?)\\.?[ \\-./]?(?:(?:19|20)\\d{2}|\\d{2})(?![A-Za-z0-9])|(?:19|20)\\d{2}[/.\\-](?:0?[1-9]|1[0-2])[/.\\-](?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])(?![\\d/.\\-])))",
            "description": "Full dates: day-first dd/mm/yyyy or dd-mm-yyyy, '5 January 1980' or '5th January 1980', and 'January 5, 1980', years 1900-2099. After DOB, D.O.B., Date of Birth or Birth Date every form of the date of birth is covered too: 23.04.1975, 23-Apr-1975, 23APR1975, 23/04/75 and 1975-04-23.",
            "enabled": true
        },
        {
            "name": "Short date",
            "regex": "(?<![\\d/\\-])(?:0?[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])/(?:0?[1-9]|1[0-2])/\\d{2}(?![\\d/])",
            "description": "Day-first date with a 2-digit year (e.g. 05/03/62). Off by default, turn it on for older records.",
            "enabled": false
        },
        {
            "name": "Postcode",
            "regex": "(?-i)(?<!\\d)(?=\\d{4}(?!\\d|[.,/\\-]\\d))(?<=\\b(?:NSW|VIC|Vic|QLD|Qld|SA|WA|TAS|Tas|NT|ACT),?[ \\t]{1,3})\\d{4}",
            "description": "Australian postcode after the state or territory: Parramatta NSW 2150, Melbourne VIC 3000, Brisbane Qld 4000, Canberra ACT 2600. A 4-digit number without the state before it (lab values, years) stays visible.",
            "enabled": true
        },
        {
            "name": "Phone",
            "regex": "(?<![A-Za-z0-9+])(?:(?:\\+61|0061)[ \\-]?(?:\\(0\\)[ \\-]?)?(?:[2378][ \\-]?\\d{4}[ \\-]?\\d{4}|4\\d{2}[ \\-]?\\d{3}[ \\-]?\\d{3})|\\(0[2378]\\)[ \\-]?\\d{4}[ \\-]?\\d{4}|0[2378][ \\-]?\\d{4}[ \\-]?\\d{4}|04(?:\\d{2}[ \\-]?\\d{3}[ \\-]?\\d{3}|[ \\-]?\\d{4}[ \\-]?\\d{4})|(?=[2-9]\\d{3}[ \\-]?\\d{4}(?!\\d))(?<=\\b(?:ph|phone|tel|telephone|fax|mob|mobile|home|work|bh|ah)\\.?\\)?[ \\t]{0,3}[:.]?[ \\t]{0,3})[2-9]\\d{3}[ \\-]?\\d{4})(?!\\d)",
            "description": "Australian phone number: (02) 9123 4567, 02 9123 4567, +61 2 9123 4567, 0412 345 678, +61 412 345 678, and 9123 4567 after Ph, Tel, Fax or Mobile. 13, 1300 and 1800 numbers stay visible.",
            "enabled": true
        },
